#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:1
msgid "融合 Softmax （Fused Softmax）"
msgstr "Fused Softmax"

#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:3
msgid "在本节中，我们将使用 Triton 编写一个融合的 softmax 操作的程序。 在此过程中，你会学习到："
msgstr ""
"In this section, we will use Triton to write a program for the fused "
"softmax operation. In this process, you will learn:"

#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:6
msgid "内核融合对于带宽受限操作的优势。"
msgstr "The advantages of kernel fusion for bandwidth-bound operations."

#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:7
msgid "Triton 中缩减操作。"
msgstr "Reduction operations in Triton."

#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:9
msgid "使用原生 PyTorch 对 X 逐行进行 Softmax 计算"
msgstr "Using Native PyTorch to Perform Softmax Operation on X Row by Row"

#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:36
msgid "内核融合的目的"
msgstr "Purpose of kernel fusion"

#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:38
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"当在 PyTorch 中以原生方式实现时，计算`y=naive_softmax(x)`需要从 DRAM 中读取 5MN+2M 个元素，并写回 "
"3MN+2M 个元素。显然这是非常低效的；我们更希望使用一个自定义的“融合”内核，它只需读取一次 x，并在芯片上完成所有必要的计算。 "
"这样一来只需读取和写回 2MN 个字节，因此我们可以期望理论上的加速比大约为 4 倍（即 (8MN+4M)/2MN）。"
msgstr ""
"When implemented naively in PyTorch, computing `y = "
"naive_softmax(x)`requires reading 5 × *MN* + 2 × *M* elements from DRAM "
"and writing back3 *MN* + 2 *M* elements. Obviously, this is very "
"inefficient. A moreefficient solution is to use a custom \"fused\" kernel"
" that reads `x`only once and completes all necessary computations on the "
"chip.Doing so requires reading and writing back only 2 × *MN* "
"bytes.Therefore, the theoretical speedup ratio is about 4 times, that is,"
" 8 ×*MN* + 4 × *M*)/2 × *MN*."

#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:41
#, fuzzy
msgid "`torch.jit.script`旨在自动执行这种“内核融合”，但它仍然远未达到理想状态。"
msgstr ""
"`torch.jit.script` is designed to automatically perform this kind "
"of\"kernel fusion\", but it is still far from ideal."

#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:43
msgid "计算内核"
msgstr "Compute Kernel"

#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:45
msgid ""
"softmax "
"内核工作原理如下：每个计算单元（program）以程序数量为步长加载输入矩阵X的一组行数据，执行归一化处理后，将结果写入输出矩阵Y。 "
"注意：Triton 的一个重要限制是每个块必须具有 2 "
"的幂次数的元素，因此，如果我们要处理任意可能的输入形状，需要在内部「填充」每一行，并确保内存操作正确性。"
msgstr ""
"The softmax kernel works as follows: Each compute unit (program) loads "
"agroup of data rows of the input matrix **X** stridden by number "
"ofprograms, normalizes it, and writes back the result to the output "
"matrix**Y**.Note: A significant limitation of Triton is that each block "
"must have apower-of-two number of elements. Therefore, to handle any "
"possible inputshapes, internally \"pad\" each row and ensure the "
"correctness of memoryoperations."

#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:76
msgid "我们可以创建一个辅助函数，该函数能够将核函数及其元参数加入执行队列，以处理任意给定的输入张量。"
msgstr ""
"Create a helper function. This function can add the kernel function "
"andits meta-parameters to the execution queue to process any given "
"inputtensor."

#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:110
msgid "单元测试"
msgstr "Unit Test"

#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:112
msgid "需要在一个具有不规则行和列数的矩阵上测试处理好的内核，此举可以验证Padding机制是否起作用"
msgstr ""
"The processed kernel needs to be tested on a matrix with irregularnumbers"
" of rows and columns. This can verify that the padding mechanismworks."

#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:126
msgid "Out:"
msgstr "Output:"

#: ../../zh/examples/02_fused_softmax_example.md:148
msgid ""
"\"The maximum difference between torch and triton is "
"1.4901161193847656e-08\" 表示Triton和PyTorch的输出结果非常接近，肉眼不可区分。"
msgstr ""
"\"The maximum difference between torch and triton "
"is1.4901161193847656e-08\" indicates that the output results of Triton "
"andPyTorch are very close and cannot be visually distinguished."

